  "To carry on on a PC, first Save progress on the phone.": "712bf26db630",
  "Then plug in the phone’s USB cable and choose File transfer on the phone.": "0fbdd4a12df4",
  "In File Explorer, copy the whole folder your work is in to the PC.": "7c9a96443b07",
  "Keep the work’s file and its folder together.": "6e2e51d72b52",
  "In StoryPrints for Windows, click Open saved work from another folder and pick the work’s file.": "6d78eb376d08",
  "Everything comes back as you left it on the phone.": "b5ee2d28284c",
